{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03502","headline":"秋日仙游观赠道士 · 王勃","name":"秋日仙游观赠道士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"石图分帝宇，银牒洞灵宫。\n回丹萦岫室，复翠上岩栊。\n雾浓金竈静，云暗玉坛空。\n野花常捧露，山叶自吟风。\n林泉明月在，诗酒故人同。\n待余逢石髓，从尔命飞鸿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王勃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03502.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03502","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}